772
00:45:30.415 --> 00:45:33.376
I just want it to get better.

773
00:45:36.463 --> 00:45:37.464
It can.

774
00:45:39.883 --> 00:45:40.884
It will.

775
00:45:42.343 --> 00:45:45.221
But it's not instant.
and it's not a straight line.

776
00:45:46.139 --> 00:45:47.390
And it may well...

777
00:45:49.392 --> 00:45:51.478
Get worse before it gets better.

778
00:46:00.695 --> 00:46:02.697
I think it's brave that you joined ho.

779
00:46:03.656 --> 00:46:06.951
Although. I admit I was a bit surprised.

780
00:46:07.952 --> 00:46:09.120
I don't blame you.

781
00:46:10.455 --> 00:46:13.583
Most people think that I'm here
to defend who my brother is...

782
00:46:14.918 --> 00:46:18.087
Was. or... What he did.

783
00:46:18.171 --> 00:46:20.799
But that's not me.

784
00:46:20.882 --> 00:46:22.592
- I'm not him.
- No. of course not.

785
00:46:23.635 --> 00:46:27.096
Must be tough trying to grieve for him.

786
00:46:28.139 --> 00:46:29.516
Knowing what he did.

787
00:46:29.599 --> 00:46:31.726
I've always known that Monty had a temper.

788
00:46:32.060 --> 00:46:34.521
The only thing
that I don't understand is Bryce.

789
00:46:36.189 --> 00:46:37.398
What do you mean?

790
00:46:37.482 --> 00:46:39.651
Bryce was like a brother to Monty.

791
00:46:39.734 --> 00:46:41.778
I mean. he was even nice to me.

792
00:46:43.822 --> 00:46:47.242
I'm sorry. I know that Bryce
has done some really terrible—

793
00:46:47.325 --> 00:46:48.576
No. it's ok.

794
00:46:49.494 --> 00:46:53.122
He was a complicated person. I think.

795
00:46:54.249 --> 00:46:57.418
You used to live at his house. didn't you?

796
00:46:58.711 --> 00:47:00.755
In the guest house. yeah.

797
00:47:00.839 --> 00:47:04.425
Did you see Monty hanging around
these last few months?

798
00:47:05.009 --> 00:47:06.094
Um...

799
00:47:06.594 --> 00:47:08.304
No. not that I can remember.

800
00:47:09.514 --> 00:47:12.267
Well. did you see anything
that would make you think

801
00:47:12.350 --> 00:47:15.895
That Monty would actually want
to hurt Bryce?

802
00:47:17.480 --> 00:47:20.316
I never saw anything like that. no.

803
00:47:27.073 --> 00:47:30.743
It's just a really challenging time
for me and my friends.

804
00:47:33.705 --> 00:47:34.539
Hey.

805
00:47:38.084 --> 00:47:39.752
Thanks for meeting me.

806
00:47:41.754 --> 00:47:43.506
I'm surprised you actually made it.

807
00:47:44.173 --> 00:47:46.759
I thought you were gonna stand me up
for the third time.

808
00:47:49.095 --> 00:47:50.847
Yeah. I'm sorry about that.

809
00:47:50.930 --> 00:47:54.809
I just...
I had a lot of things... Going on.

810
00:47:56.185 --> 00:47:57.312
A lot of what?

811
00:47:58.563 --> 00:48:00.273
Driving around and drinking?

812
00:48:03.693 --> 00:48:05.778
Just school and shit.

813
00:48:08.156 --> 00:48:09.449
Zach. what's going on?

814
00:48:10.408 --> 00:48:11.826
This is not the way you are.

815
00:48:12.785 --> 00:48:14.078
What's not the way I am?

816
00:48:15.413 --> 00:48:17.040
Like. not showing up.

817
00:48:17.999 --> 00:48:19.125
Not calling.

818
00:48:20.877 --> 00:48:22.211
Not looking at me.

819
00:48:24.380 --> 00:48:26.007
Um...

820
00:48:32.013 --> 00:48:33.640
- Oh. zachy.

821
00:48:33.973 --> 00:48:35.850
- Zach. what is it?

822
00:48:38.770 --> 00:48:40.229
Shit's just...

823
00:48:42.565 --> 00:48:43.691
Shit's fucked up.

824
00:48:45.652 --> 00:48:46.736
What do you mean?

825
00:48:48.154 --> 00:48:50.782
Tell me what happened.
and we'll figure out a way to fix it.

826
00:48:50.865 --> 00:48:52.450
No. there's no...

827
00:48:55.036 --> 00:48:56.245
There's no fixing this.

828
00:48:58.998 --> 00:49:01.626
We're all just desperate
for something better.

829
00:49:03.086 --> 00:49:04.045
More true.

830
00:49:04.879 --> 00:49:07.048
Did it hurt when you did it?

831
00:49:08.591 --> 00:49:11.177
I'm sorry. you don't have to answer that.
That's none of my—

832
00:49:11.260 --> 00:49:12.553
No. it's ok.

833
00:49:13.429 --> 00:49:14.305
Um...

834
00:49:15.014 --> 00:49:16.015
I thought…

835
00:49:18.017 --> 00:49:20.645
I don't even know what I thought.

836
00:49:20.728 --> 00:49:24.023
And I never really thought
about how it'd feel. like. after.

837
00:49:24.107 --> 00:49:25.692
You know. how fucked up i'd be.

838
00:49:26.484 --> 00:49:28.987
'cause I didn't think
there was gonna be any after.

839
00:49:29.070 --> 00:49:31.698
I really wish
i would've considered that possibility.

840
00:49:31.781 --> 00:49:33.491
I don't think you fucked up. Alex.

841
00:49:34.283 --> 00:49:37.161
I think it's kind of amazing. actually.
where you are now.

842
00:49:37.620 --> 00:49:38.788
Yeah.

843
00:49:39.247 --> 00:49:42.291
I mean. I've worked really hard
with the physical therapy and stuff.

844
00:49:42.375 --> 00:49:44.544
I finally got rid of that fucking cane.

845
00:49:44.961 --> 00:49:49.549
But... I don't know.
I'm never gonna be. like. normal again.

846
00:49:49.632 --> 00:49:51.134
Hey. Well. fuck normal.

847
00:49:51.843 --> 00:49:53.177
What does that even mean?

848
00:49:54.178 --> 00:49:56.514
Nobody ever actually feels normal.

849
00:49:58.099 --> 00:49:59.517
Yeah. I guess that's true.

850
00:50:00.893 --> 00:50:04.105
I'm sure it helps. you know.
having such a good group of friends.

851
00:50:04.313 --> 00:50:07.567
Tyler's always telling me you guys are so.
you know. close and everything.

852
00:50:07.775 --> 00:50:10.737
Yeah. we're not as close
as we used to be. but…

853
00:50:12.280 --> 00:50:14.032
Well. why not?

854
00:50:14.991 --> 00:50:18.536
I mean. you know.
they're great. and we're all great.

855
00:50:18.619 --> 00:50:21.289
It's just we don't hang out
as much lately.

856
00:50:23.124 --> 00:50:25.376
That's good news for me. I guess.
I mean...

857
00:50:27.211 --> 00:50:29.922
I don't really have a lot of friends
at Liberty. so...

858
00:50:31.049 --> 00:50:32.425
I'm really glad you called.

859
00:50:33.134 --> 00:50:34.427
Yeah. me too.

860
00:50:41.392 --> 00:50:42.477
- Shall we?

861
00:50:46.189 --> 00:50:47.648
Bill mentioned cameras?

862
00:50:47.732 --> 00:50:50.026
I'm not sure how I feel about cameras.

863
00:50:50.443 --> 00:50:52.153
Oh. hey. Clay. Uh...

864
00:50:54.155 --> 00:50:55.740
We were just talking about you.

865
00:50:59.744 --> 00:51:01.454
What's going on? Did something happen?

866
00:51:01.537 --> 00:51:04.207
No. I was just. uh.
checking in with your folks.

867
00:51:06.584 --> 00:51:09.045
- About what?
- Sheriff Diaz is walking us through

868
00:51:09.128 --> 00:51:11.339
Some of the new security measures
for the school.

869
00:51:11.422 --> 00:51:12.548
Given all the tension lately.

870
00:51:12.632 --> 00:51:14.759
I wanted to make sure
your parents were aware

871
00:51:14.842 --> 00:51:19.430
That we're doing everything we can
to keep you and everyone else at Liberty

872
00:51:19.514 --> 00:51:20.973
As safe as possible.

873
00:51:21.432 --> 00:51:22.308
That's...

874
00:51:23.434 --> 00:51:24.435
That's excellent.

875
00:51:26.813 --> 00:51:27.855
Well. i. uh...

876
00:51:28.606 --> 00:51:30.233
I should probably get to work.

877
00:51:30.733 --> 00:51:32.235
College essays and everything.

878
00:51:44.163 --> 00:51:45.289
Did you see Diaz?

879
00:51:47.291 --> 00:51:48.126
Yeah.

880
00:51:49.877 --> 00:51:51.129
This isn't good. is it?

881
00:51:52.630 --> 00:51:53.548
No.

882
00:51:54.966 --> 00:51:56.092
This isn't good.

883
00:52:05.268 --> 00:52:07.270
Clay. what the fuck is wrong with you?

884
00:52:10.064 --> 00:52:12.108
- I'm having a panic attack.

885
00:52:20.074 --> 00:52:22.451
"the lessons we take
from obstacles we encounter

886
00:52:22.535 --> 00:52:24.829
Can be fundamental to later success.

887
00:52:25.538 --> 00:52:29.417
Recount a time when you faced
a challenge. setback. or failure.

888
00:52:29.500 --> 00:52:30.877
How did it affect you.

889
00:52:30.960 --> 00:52:33.129
And what did you learn
from the experience?"

890
00:53:08.623 --> 00:53:10.958
Yeah. things are gonna get worse.

891
00:53:11.042 --> 00:53:12.668
Much. much worse...

892
00:53:18.549 --> 00:53:20.343
Until something makes them better.

893
00:55:53.788 --> 00:55:55.664
Well done. ed. Well done.

